# hexyl: A command-line hex viewer (https://github.com/sharkdp/hexyl)
# By `nami recipe from-url https://github.com/sharkdp/hexyl --version 0.17.0`: a Rust project, built with Cargo; its crates come as its Cargo.lock pins them.
# Its sha256 is in nami.lock, next to this file. Check it, then: nami build ./rust-hexyl
name: hexyl
version: 0.17.0
